I'm not certain I understand your problem.  However, the situation you describe in your final paragraph where the data import did not produce what you intended, may be caused by failure to sort the data before import.

Before importing your data into Distance, make sure you have your data sorted first by strata (if you have strata), then by transect within stratum.  In other words, all information regarding transect 6 must occur together in your file.

If you are still having problems, perhaps we can exchange data off-list.

